            "review_title": "Review at Quán Gold Beer",
            "review_text": "Lis B\n2 contributions\n0\nThe best food ever.\nMar 2023 • Couples\nAmazing! This place is the PERFECT spot for delicious dinner, beer, and a place to meet and chat with the locals. My boyfriend and I went there on our first night in Buon Ma Thuot as we were just looking for a beer but it instantly became our favourite restaurant in the world. The inexpensive menu had a huge variety with everything from a simple plate of tasty noodles, to delicacies and authentic grilled meats. The people are what really makes it though. Super friendly vibe from all of the staff and other patrons even through the language barrier, we made lots of friends over the many times we just had to come back, even with the chef himself. I couldn’t recommend this place enough!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 29, 2023",
